        // "Navigate here" flow): SignalK v2 course accepts
        //   PUT /navigation/course/destination { position: {lat, lon} }
        // and skips the persistent waypoint resource that the old
        // flow created as a side effect. The previous implementation
        // also stopped at the first failure with no diagnostics, which
        // looked like "Navigate Here does nothing" to the helm.
        double lat = contextMenuLat, lon = contextMenuLon;
